# Build-artifact directories.  The build-infra Makefile builds into the
# repo-local build/mesa-<profile>/ tree (the /build entry above ignores it), and
# `make clean` removes the active profile's subdir there.  A hand-run `meson
# setup builddir` (the canonical shape in AGENTS.md) instead lands in-tree as
# builddir/, so guard the documented builddir names against accidental commits.
/builddir
/builddir-*/
# clangd / tooling compilation database, regenerated from any build directory.
compile_commands.json

# macOS Finder/AppleDouble metadata from NFS, SMB, and removable-media copies.
.DS_Store
._*
**/._*
.AppleDouble
**/.AppleDouble

# GNU global / clangd index files (generated locally for
# RE / RCA / audit tier-S tooling; per-developer artifacts).
GTAGS
GPATH
GRTAGS
*.tag
*.taghl
tags
TAGS
